  "pr469_body_excerpts": [
    "- **Engine cost.** The new mana-payment, casting, proposed-event and trigger paths slow headless `bench_steps` by 9.2% on unchanged decks: 12,880 \u2192 11,694 steps/s on AMD EPYC 7763. Both candidate samples were slower than both reference samples, and user CPU tracked wall time, so this is engine cost rather than runner noise. It is adopted as an accepted cost from [CI run 43221435403](https://github.com/loopflowstudio/manabot/actions/runs/43221435403); search stayed within budget.",
    "- **Not yet tried after merge.** No v10 training run has been made yet. A short v10 pilot over decks containing the three v10 cards would be a useful next check: training should finish without encoder refusals, and `player_turn_state` / `card_turn_state` should be non-zero in positions where those cards matter."
  ],
